==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
The hardest part in this stage is making sure the Zombies don't destroy your Cat Base, since the reduced cat limit can make balancing frontline and backline protection difficult. [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] can help stall the Zombies, but remember to bring something for the Aliens. [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] is a useful anti-Alien meatshield, and Chill Cat can help deal good stackable DPS against the Aliens.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
-

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Simply use [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts]], or any other Starting Money [[Cat Combo]] and send out [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] as soon as you can. There are hardly any enemies here, and the base has very low HP, letting him solo the stage.

